      "content": "i know i should check with my doctor but i cant really get an appointment until next week and i feel terrible right now. i dont want to take too much, but 500mg feels like a tiny amount for this headache. is it safe if i just do 1000mg every few hours? i feel like my liver is fine since i finished my main treatments a while ago.",
